{"id":"00661","root":"uni00661_1","name":{"ja":"新鋭カヲル","en":"Rising Star Kaworu"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"新鋭カヲル","en":"Rising Star Kaworu"},"aliases":["Shin'ei Kaworu"],"element":"Spiritual","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2023-02-16","limited":true,"characterId":376,"profile":{"ja":"ふうま八将の一角・二車家に仕える鉄華院家の若き対魔忍。忍法“鎖遁の術”という両手の平より特殊な鎖を出現させる術を使う。この鎖は自在に動き、鞭の様に打ち据えたり捕縛したりする上、捕縛した者の罪の重さの分だけ頑丈に重くなる“邪なる鎖縛”ともなるが、まだ使いこなしきれているとは言えない。鉄華院家当主である父・鉄華院卍鉄とは折り合いが悪く、その方針に疑問を抱いている。","en":"She is a young Taimanin of the Tekkain family serving the Nisha house, one of the eight Fuuma generals. She uses the ninjutsu \"Chain Escape Technique,\" which summons special chains from both palms. These chains move freely, can strike like a whip or bind, and become heavier and sturdier in proportion to the weight of the captive's sins, known as \"Evil Chain Bind,\" though she has not yet fully mastered it. She has a strained relationship with her father, Tekkain Bantetsu, the head of the Tekkain family, and questions his policies."},"illustrator":"さのとしひで","voiceActor":"杉原茉莉","forms":[{"id":"uni00661_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[868,1736],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[184,368],"def":[136,272],"spd":[59,59],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["3","1770001"],"evolve":[["evo00007",5],["evo00008",15],["evo00009",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00661_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1236,2472],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[303,606],"def":[207,414],"spd":[59,59],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["3","1770001","1770002"],"evolve":[["evo00008",10],["evo00009",15],["evo00016",4],["evo00017",2]]},{"id":"uni00661_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[1604,3209],"sp":[350,350],"atk":[427,855],"def":[283,567],"spd":[59,59],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["3","1770001","1770002","1770003"]}],"skills":{"3":{"slot":"attack","id":3,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"l